# ili9341-linux-aarch64

The generic hosted board with its MCU pointed at the emulated controller
behind an ILI9341 module's glass, on the Arduino Uno pins Adafruit's ILI9341
examples use. Everything else is inherited from the generic board. There is
no mm.display binding: modules.cpp has no ILI9341 driver, so this board is for
sketches that bring Adafruit's.
